### Pruebas manuales de POST /loans (extensión REST Client de VS Code). Datos ficticios.
### Ejecútalas en orden. Si ya existe el préstamo de prueba, la primera da 409: cambia last4.
@host = http://localhost:3001

### 1. Préstamo válido -> 201 { "id": ... }
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Libre inversión",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "9876",
  "principalCents": 1000000000,
  "termMonths": 12,
  "firstPaymentDate": "2026-02-10",
  "insuranceCents": 1200000,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "0.195618" }
}

### 2. El mismo otra vez -> 409
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Libre inversión",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "9876",
  "principalCents": 1000000000,
  "termMonths": 12,
  "firstPaymentDate": "2026-02-10",
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "0.195618" }
}

### 3. Con la cuota informada por el banco -> 201
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vehículo",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "2468",
  "principalCents": 1000000000,
  "termMonths": 12,
  "firstPaymentDate": "2026-02-10",
  "fixedPaymentCents": 91679993,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "0.195618", "mv": "0.015" }
}

### 4. Cuota informada en 0 -> 400
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vehículo",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "1111",
  "principalCents": 1000000000,
  "termMonths": 12,
  "firstPaymentDate": "2026-02-10",
  "fixedPaymentCents": 0,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "0.195618" }
}

### 5. Sin tasa -> 400
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vehículo",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "2222",
  "principalCents": 1000000000,
  "termMonths": 12,
  "firstPaymentDate": "2026-02-10",
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01" }
}
